formals of s_formals:
  x: no direction, typespec NULL
  w: no direction, logic typespec
  i: input, int typespec
  o: output, int typespec
  io: inout, int typespec
variables of s_vars: cnt flag
full name of s_vars: test_vpi_sequence_decl_operands.s_vars
full name of s_gen: test_vpi_sequence_decl_operands.g.s_gen
s_and: and, operands: a b
s_or: or, operands: b c
s_udel: unary ##, operands: a 1 3
s_udel2: unary ##, operands: b 2
s_bdel: ##, operands: a c 2 4
s_bdel1: ##, operands: c b 1
s_rep: [*], operands: a 1 3
s_rep2: [*], operands: b 2
s_goto: [->], operands: c 2 4
s_nc: [=], operands: a 3
s_dist: ##, operands: (distribution of a) b 1
s_expr: &&, operands: a b
s_one: expression c
s_match: first operand a, match items: assignment to cnt2, call of mark
